# The exporter image's toolchain (images/models-export/Dockerfile). NOT a runtime set:
# it exports models (torch -> ONNX), converts them (fp16, INT8) and checks them on the
# GPU. Locked by images/lock.sh into requirements.lock, linux/x86_64 only -- it runs on
# the EC2 GPU host.
#
# torch/transformers/tokenizers/numpy are the worker's pins; onnxruntime-gpu is the
# server's onnxruntime version. ONLY the -gpu build: nothing here may pull the CPU
# `onnxruntime` too (two builds in one env shadow each other -- plan §8 3b item 2).
# 1.30.0's [cuda,cudnn] extras are CUDA 13 + cuDNN 9 wheels (tools/onnx-export/FINDINGS.md finding 1).
torch==2.14.0
transformers==5.17.0
tokenizers==0.23.2
numpy==2.4.6
onnx==1.23.2
onnxconverter-common==1.16.0
onnxruntime-gpu[cuda,cudnn]==1.30.0
